# Local working data: the Songs scan, the mel cache, the packed shards, the
# beatmapset cache, scratch .osz files. All of it is machine-local and
# regenerated by scripts/pack_dataset.py -- nothing under data/ is source.
# Ignoring the directory rather than naming files keeps a deleted generator
# from leaving its output untracked, which is what happened to
# data/unranked_review.csv when export_unranked_csv.py was removed.
data/
*.npy

